<p>A finishing uppercut that deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">141%, 154%, 164%, 172%, 180%</acronym> damage, and attempts to stun your target for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns, depending on the amount of combo points you've accumulated.</p><p>The stun chance will improve with your Physical Power.</p><p>Using this talent removes your combo points.</p>